>   WHERE (b.unique2, random() > 0) = ANY (SELECT q1, random() > 0 FROM a5_i8 c WHERE c.q1 < b.unique1)
QUERY PLAN:text
Hash Join
  Hash Cond: (b.unique2 = a.unique1)
  ->  Seq Scan on a5_onek b
        Filter: (ANY ((unique2 = (SubPlan 1).col1) AND ((random() > '0'::double precision) = (SubPlan 1).col2)))
        SubPlan 1
          ->  Seq Scan on a5_i8 c
                Filter: (q1 < b.unique1)
  ->  Hash
        ->  Seq Scan on a5_onek a
